{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>無論是購物收據還是家電保固，總有需要證明文件的時候。KeepProof 是一款專為整理收據與追蹤保固而設計的智能工具，讓你無需再翻箱倒櫃找紙本憑證。目前 App 正在提供終生版內購限時免費，錯過不再。</p>\n\n<h2>一鍵儲存輕鬆查找</h2>\n<p>只需拍攝或匯入收據，系統便自動識別資訊，無需手動輸入。你可以為同一張收據附加多項物品，並加入備註、產品照片或保固到期日。日後無論是要退貨、維修還是申請保固，只要搜尋商品名稱或商店，就能在幾秒內找到對應收據，省時又省力。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-78-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-79-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-80-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-81-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>KeepProof – receipt &amp; warranty 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：KeepProof – receipt &amp; warranty</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-19T06:18:58.997471+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}